WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.025
Module 14.

00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:03.760
Automation & Mastery.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.645
Part of Stage 5, Operator.

00:00:06.945 --> 00:00:09.222
By the end of this module, you'll be

00:00:09.222 --> 00:00:12.298
able to monitor and automate safely, run multisig

00:00:12.298 --> 00:00:15.490
operations, and complete the operator capstone.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:16.845
That's the standard.

00:00:16.845 --> 00:00:18.815
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:20.115 --> 00:00:22.249
There are 6 lessons, starting with

00:00:22.249 --> 00:00:25.780
Monitoring: dashboards, alerts and on-chain watchers.

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.759
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:27.759 --> 00:00:30.030
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.020
If the topic is new to

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:36.040
you, start with Mastery Starter 14.0.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:37.935
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:37.935 --> 00:00:40.089
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:40.089 --> 00:00:42.220
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:44.027
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:44.027 --> 00:00:46.060
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:50.015
Let's begin, with lesson 14.0.
